          "text": "MAS's September 2026 stablecoin announcement describes consultation on legislative amendments, including the framework for qualifying MAS-regulated stablecoins. It covers Singapore-issued single-currency stablecoins pegged to SGD or a G10 currency and discusses proposals concerning foreign issuance. A consultation proposal should not be reported as a licence already granted to a particular issuer. [1] [2] [3]"
